  "editorial": [
    {
      "heading": "League roundup.",
      "text": "Gorgie’s 8–2 victory over Carrubbers was their first league win of the campaign. South East Saints also recorded their first league victory, winning 3–2 at St Marys to end the hosts’ unbeaten league start. Ladywell won 5–1 at Barclay Viewforth, while The Mission drew 3–3 with Murrayburn and Liberton drew 2–2 with Kirkliston."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The final is set.",
      "text": "North Berwick’s 6–5 penalty shoot-out win over White Lightning, after a 2–2 draw, sets up a Knockout Cup final against The Mission. The public fixture is listed for 21 November at Pennypit, with a 10:00 UK kick-off. Check the live fixture for any changes."
    }
